== W 243 "`implicit` parameters are no longer supported, use a `using` clause instead\nThis construct can be rewritten automatically under -rewrite -source future-migration."
== W 175 "Alphanumeric method plus is not declared infix; it should not be used as infix operator.\nInstead, use method syntax .plus(...) or backticked identifier `plus`.\nThe latter can be rewritten automatically under -rewrite -source 3.4-migration."
== W 231 "The trailing ` _` for eta-expansion is unnecessary;\nthe compiler performs eta-expansion automatically, so you can write the function value directly instead.\nThis construct can be rewritten automatically under -rewrite -source 3.4-migration."
== W 278 "Implicit parameters should be provided with a `using` clause.\nThis code can be rewritten automatically under -rewrite -source 3.7-migration.\nTo disable the warning, please use the following option:\n  \"-Wconf:msg=Implicit parameters should be provided with a `using` clause:s\"\n"
